Package: fft-benchmark
Version: %%VERSION%%
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: %%ARCH%%
Depends: libc6, libgcc-s1, libstdc++6
Maintainer: Robert Fuszenecker <robert.fuszenecker@outlook.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/hg2ecz/ProgrammingLanguageBenchmark-FFT_4096
Description: FFT benchmark in C# with native C and Rust implementations
 Self-contained .NET build of the C# version of Zsolt Krüpl's FFT benchmark.
 It compares the managed C# FFT with the same algorithm implemented in C and
 Rust, called through P/Invoke.
